### Đăng nhập (tài khoản demo của profile local)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone": "090 123 4567", "password": "Admin@123456"}

### Hồ sơ của tôi
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Hồ sơ theo ID: 200
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Không tìm thấy: 404
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/users/999
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ID không hợp lệ: 400
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/users/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Làm mới token
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.data.refreshToken}}"}

### Không có token: 401
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/users/1

### Health
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health
